cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FocusParse: Evidence Packets for High-Resolution Document QA"
message: "If you use FocusParse in your research, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bo
    given-names: Gabriel
date-released: 2026-05-27
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/run-llama/focusparse"
abstract: >-
  FocusParse is a reproducible research harness for high-resolution document
  question answering. It constructs citation-grounded evidence packets over
  finance reports and technical datasheets, then evaluates answer correctness,
  page recall, bounding-box grounding, cost, latency, and lazy-answer behavior
  on parser-bench.
